      },
      "rationale": "Runs in the child before it reads its request: routes SIGTERM and SIGALRM to the group kill, arms the child's own alarm, asks the kernel for SIGTERM when the parent dies, and ends the child at once when its recorded parent is not its parent any more.",
      "role": "enforcement"
    },
